#### 2. Attributes Tab Implementation
- **Complete Attributes Tab Created** - Full HTML structure with all three attribute categories
- **Tab Button Added** - Added "Attributes" tab button between Basic Info and Traits
- **Attribute Categories** - Implemented Physical (Strength, Dexterity, Stamina), Social (Charisma, Manipulation, Appearance), and Mental (Intelligence, Wits, Perception)
- **Interactive Controls** - Plus/minus buttons for each attribute with data attributes for JavaScript interaction
- **XP Tracking** - Category summaries showing total counts and XP costs
- **Responsive Design** - Grid layout that works on mobile and desktop
- **Progress Bar Update** - Updated from 12.5% (1/8) to 11.11% (1/9) per tab

### Technical Implementation Details

#### HTML Structure (`lotn_char_create.php`)
- **Tab Button**: Added `<button class="tab tab-btn" data-tab="attributes">Attributes</button>` in correct position
- **Tab Content**: Created complete `attributesTab` div with:
  - Info box with attribute distribution rules
  - 3x3 attribute grid (9 attributes total)
  - Plus/minus controls for each attribute
  - Category summary sections for Physical, Social, and Mental
