#### Progress Indicator Updates
- **Progress Bar Width**: Changed from 12.5% to 11.11% per tab step
- **Tab Count**: Updated references from 8 tabs to 9 tabs throughout

#### Data Attributes for JavaScript
- Each attribute has `data-attribute` and `data-category` attributes
- Plus/minus buttons have `data-action` attributes for event handling
- Proper ID structure for JavaScript selectors

